If you give a person a picture in a frame, a hammer, and a nail, most people would understand:

"Ikse now has to hang the picture frame on the wall with the nail."

...although it wouldn't be clear in this situation exactly where on the wall the nail needs to be hammered, the next logical action would be obvious to most.

With image recognition, you can easily recognize a nail, a hammer, and a picture frame. Are there already AIs that can also understand "hang the picture on the wall with the nail" as the next action?

